Description: Prepare colour-ring data from 'CR-Briding'
    (<https://cr-birding.org/>) for publication in a research repository. With
    'crbirding' you can transform CR-Birding data to Darwin Core for publication
    to the Global Biodiversity Information Facility ('GBIF') and the Ocean
    Biodiversity Information System ('OBIS').
